### Phase 22 — Organization permission smoke tests
@apiBase = http://localhost:4000
@token = paste-admin-token-here
@organizationId = paste-organization-id-here

### List organizations
GET {{apiBase}}/api/admin/users/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create organization
POST {{apiBase}}/api/admin/users/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Phase 22 Test Organization"
}

### Reject duplicate organization name
POST {{apiBase}}/api/admin/users/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Phase 22 Test Organization"
}

### Update organization
PUT {{apiBase}}/api/admin/users/organizations/{{organizationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Phase 22 Test Organization Updated"
}

### Delete organization
DELETE {{apiBase}}/api/admin/users/organizations/{{organizationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
